<title>UK: Pizza Express H1 pretax profit 6.28 mln.</title>
<headline>Pizza Express H1 pretax profit 6.28 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.6		    vs 5.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 0.85		   vs 0.7</p>
<p> Pretax		     6.28		   vs 4.15</p>
<p> Turnover		   30.65		  vs 19.53</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Pizza Express Plc. The company said the outlook for the year was strong.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
